DXの推進」をテーマに、地域課題の解決に取り組む優良事例を紹介する「中国地域DX推進セミナー」が広島市で開催され、オンライン参加を含む約170人が参加しました。\n詳しくは👉https://t.co/tG6S5nChKa https://t.co/X8mvMhAnLv","id_str":"2108437404336194030","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"1469058582"},"rest_id":"2108437404336194030","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"4297","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}},{"entryId":"list-conversation-2108662825902669874-tweet-2108481921563181171","item":{"clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"地域社会DXナビ","height":144,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108370809760907264/VD3oPUzw?format=jpg&name=144x144_2","width":144},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"AI(人工知能)とICT(情報通信技術)を組み合わせ、地域課題の解決に取り組む優良事例を紹介する「中国地域DX推進セミナー」（主催＝総務省中国総合通信局、一般社団法人電子情報通信学会中国支部、共催＝中国地方非常通信協議会、中国情報通信懇談会、中国地域ICT産学官連携フォーラム）が2026年７月31日、広島市南区の「TKPガーデンシティPREMIUM広島駅前」で開催されました。「AI×ICTに...","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"dx-navi.soumu.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"地域社会DXナビ","height":420,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108370809760907264/VD3oPUzw?format=jpg&name=420x420_2","width":420},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"地域社会DXナビ","height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108370809760907264/VD3oPUzw?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"地域社会DXナビ","height":100,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108370809760907264/VD3oPUz