ext":"【下請法・取適法で複数の違反】\nパーパス㈱は、下請事業者又は中小受託事業者に対し、①手形払による支払遅延、②振込手数料の減額、③金型等の無償保管を行っていたため、下請法又は取適法に基づく勧告を行いました。\nhttps://t.co/Lx7BvuG6GM\n#下請法　#取適法 https://t.co/S0hSmSPT1c","id_str":"2108447123012476966","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":30,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"2455900080"},"rest_id":"2108447123012476966","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"4082","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2108447123012476966","sortIndex":"2108662825902669750"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":120,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2106374580218851328/SNtcjVSe?format=jpg&name=120x120","width":120},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"　大量の個人情報を取り扱う事業者等の情報システムが不正アクセスにより侵入され、個人情報を含むデータが窃取される事案が相次いで確認されています。 　このような状況を踏まえ、内閣官房国家サイバー統括室から、事業者等に対し、迅速な脆弱性対応や、多要素認証等の認証機能の強化、漏えいした情報の悪用を防止する対策等について、委託先も含めた一層の対策の徹底を速やかに検討するよう、注意喚起が行われています。...","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.soumu.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":120,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2106374580218851328/SNtcjVSe?format=jpg&name=120x120","width":120},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":120,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2106374580218851328/SNtcjVSe?format=jpg&name=orig","width":120},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"site","value":{"scribe_key":"publisher_id","type":"USER","user_value":{"id_str":"1469058582","pa